      "edits": [
        {
          "start": 10,
          "end": 11,
          "current": "`--receipt-stdout-seal` and its nonce occur exactly once. The nonce is 1..64 bytes, each an ASCII letter, digit, hyphen or underscore, and must not start with `--` (a flag-like missing/invalid value). A single leading hyphen and interior hyphens are valid. It is an opaque correlation value, not a secret or authorization. Empty, overlong, Unicode, whitespace, duplicate and missing values refuse with usage status2 before Project authority. The sealed form requires exactly one `--retained-receipt`; ordinary source, plan and explain forms cannot select it. All ordinary selectors and bounds retain their existing validation and diagnostic order. Absent the new flag, original single-codec, plan, explain and retained-receipt behavior is unchanged.\n",
          "previous": "`--receipt-stdout-seal` and its nonce occur exactly once. The nonce is 1..64 bytes, each an ASCII letter, digit, hyphen or underscore. It is an opaque correlation value, not a secret or authorization. Empty, overlong, Unicode, whitespace, duplicate and missing values refuse with usage status2 before Project authority. The sealed form requires exactly one `--retained-receipt`; ordinary source, plan and explain forms cannot select it. All ordinary selectors and bounds retain their existing validation and diagnostic order. Absent the new flag, original single-codec, plan, explain and retained-receipt behavior is unchanged.\n"
        }
      ]
